Author: CusDeb OS Team
Description: Enlarge the WineMine and Spider graphics on high-DPI screens.
 Both games draw fixed-size bitmaps. Enlarge them by the whole factor
 nearest to DPI / 96 with pixel replication: WineMine scales its
 bitmaps, cell sizes and margins, cardlib scales the card bitmaps and
 Spider its gaps. Above 96 DPI WineMine also keeps its window at least
 as wide as the menu bar, which wraps onto a second line and covers the
 board when the menu font is larger than the board is wide.
